WEBVTT

00:05:29.241 --> 00:05:32.536
and our early data suggests
that it reduces newborn deaths

00:05:32.578 --> 00:05:34.205
by 18 percent.

00:05:34.872 --> 00:05:38.834
(Applause)

00:05:38.876 --> 00:05:42.296
That would mean that over nine
babies' lives are saved

00:05:42.338 --> 00:05:44.382
for every 1,000 live births.

00:05:44.673 --> 00:05:47.426
And it's all happening
at an extremely low cost

00:05:47.468 --> 00:05:50.679
because the solution
leverages existing resources.

00:05:51.472 --> 00:05:53.140
SA: I had the chance to meet Bino.

00:05:53.599 --> 00:05:57.353
He's a young man who had heart surgery
at the nearest major hospital to him,

00:05:57.395 --> 00:05:59.021
which was in Kolkata.

00:05:59.063 --> 00:06:02.191
He was accompanied
by his wife Sunita and his uncle,